 to purchase products seamlessly in stores or through our digital channels. Since 1946, we have given 5 percent of our profit to communities.","zh":"Target Corporation 於 1902 年在明尼蘇達州成立。我們的企業宗旨是幫助所有家庭發現日常生活的樂趣。我們以折扣價為我們的客戶（稱為「客人」）提供時尚、差異化的商品和日常必需品。我們作為一個單一部門運營，旨在使客人能夠在商店或透過我們的數位管道無縫購買產品。自 1946 年以來，我們將 5% 的利潤捐給社區。"},{"en":"When used in this report, the terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" \"Target,\" and the \"Corporation\" mean Target Corporation and its subsidiaries, collectively, unless the context otherwise requires or indicates.","zh":"本報告中所使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」、「目標公司」和「本公司」統指目標公司及其子公司，除非上下文另有要求或指明。"},{"en":"Target's strategy is grounded in our purpose to help all families discover the joy of everyday life and our ambition to be the most delightful experience in retail. We differentiate through design, style, and value, and a curated multi-category assortment delivered across stores and digital channels.","zh":"Target 的策略是基於我們幫助所有家庭發現日常生活樂趣的宗旨以及我們打造最令人愉悅的零售體驗的雄心壯志。我們透過設計、風格和價值以及跨商店和數位管道提供的精心策劃的多類別產品來實現差異化。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Target Corporation was incorporated in Minnesota in 1902. Our corporate purpose is to help all families discover the joy of everyday life. We offer our customers, referred to as \"guests,\" fashionable, differentiated merchandise and everyday essentials at discounted prices. We operate as a single segment designed to enable guests to purchase products seamlessly in stores or through our digital channels. Since 1946, we have given 5 percent of our profit to communities.","zh":"Target Corporation 於 1902 年在明尼蘇達州成立。我們的企業宗旨是幫助所有家庭發現日常生活的樂趣。我們以折扣價為我們的客戶（稱為「客人」）提供時尚、差異化的商品和日常必需品。我們作為一個單一部門運營，旨在使客人能夠在商店或透過我們的數位管道無縫購買產品。自 1946 年以來，我們將 5% 的利潤捐給社區。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with omnichannel retailers, including department stores, off-price general merchandise retailers, wholesale clubs, category-specific retailers, drug stores, supermarkets, direct-to-consumer brands, online marketplaces, and other forms of retail commerce. Our ability to positively differentiate ourselves from other retailers and provide compelling value to our guests largely determines our competitive position within the retail industry.","zh":"我們與全通路零售商競爭，包括百貨公司、特價百貨零售商、批發俱樂部、特定類別零售商、藥局、超市、直接面向消費者的品牌、線上市場和其他形式的零售商業。我們積極區別於其他零售商並為客人提供引人注目的價值的能力在很大程度上決定了我們在零售業的競爭地位。"},{"en":"Our brand image is a critical element of our business strategy. Our principal trademarks, including Target, our \"Expect More. Pay Less.\" brand promise, and our \"Bullseye Design,\" have been registered with the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office. We also seek to obtain and preserve intellectual property protection for our brands.","zh":"我們的品牌形像是我們業務策略的關鍵要素。我們的主要商標，包括 Target、我們的「期待更多，付出更少」。品牌承諾和我們的「靶心設計」已在美國專利商標局註冊。我們也尋求為我們的品牌取得並維護智慧財產權保護。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":24136000000,"zh":"食品及飲料"},{"name":"Household Essentials","val":18017000000,"zh":"家居必需品"},{"name":"Hardlines","val":15800000000,"zh":"Hardlines"},{"name":"Apparel & Accessories","val":15737000000,"zh":"服飾及配件"},{"name":"Home Furnishings & Decor","val":15608000000,"zh":"居家陳設及裝飾"},{"name":"Beauty","val":13214000000,"zh":"美麗"},{"name":"Advertising Revenue","val":915000000,"zh":"廣告收入"},{"name":"Other Other Revenue","val":626000000,"zh":"其他 其他收入"},{"name":"Credit Card Profit Sharing","val":522000000,"zh":"信用卡利潤分享"},{"name":"Other Product","val":205000000,"zh":"其他產品"}],"total":104780000000}},"peers":["WMT","COST","LOW","HD","SBUX"]}}